{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/132837-so-constantine-has-a-new-series-premiering-on-nbc-this-fall","id":132837,"title":"So Constantine has a new series premiering on NBC this Fall...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-11T15:55:43-07:00","id":132837,"title":"So Constantine has a new series premiering on NBC this Fall...","content":"And it looks quite good.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://io9.com/the-first-trailer-for-constantine-looks-amazing-1574801088/+Fahey\" target=\"_blank\">http://io9.com/the-first-trailer-for...4801088/+Fahey</a><br /> <br /> Thought it might interest some of you folks, especially with M20 right around the corner : )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T16:13:35-07:00","id":132854,"title":"","content":"The actor's voice isn't quite what I imagine it to sound like when reading the comics, but if that's the only thing I can nitpick then sign me up! I'm glad to see NBC hasn't been shying away from the graphic violence lately (Grimm and Hannibal for example), I wouldn't want a watered down Hellblazer adaptation. This trailer looks quite promising, hopefully the show erases the taste of the movie from our collective mouths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum