> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/132837-so-constantine-has-a-new-series-premiering-on-nbc-this-fall?p=133179#post133179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah, sometimes mixing things that are good results in a foul tasting mess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sonja Blue, we're looking at you!<br /> <br /> (jk, I never actually read her x-over with the WoD; was it any good?)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T18:17:49-07:00","id":144000,"title":"","content":"It was ok, I still have a copy on the bookshelf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T12:34:23-07:00","id":145922,"title":"","content":"Trailer does look pretty good, and Constantine seems spot on, but why set this in America? Doesn't the runaway success of Dr. Who prove that yanks can get into brit settings?<br /> <br /> There actually seem to be a few plot points in common with the movie (electrocuting Constantine, introducing the female costar to the supernatural world with the line &quot;when you see them they can see you&quot;...I just hope he doesn't use guns in this!) I didn't hate the movie, btw; it was a pretty good &quot;supernatural detective&quot; flick, it just wasn't Hellblazer, really. It did do a decent job of capturing the &quot;feel&quot; of Vertigo comics, imo...<br /> <br /> Hmm, what are the odds of seeing some other DC magic characters, like Zatanna or the Stranger, in this, I wonder? <br /> <br /> I'm already predicting the Supernatural fandom is gonna hate it...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T12:41:02-07:00","id":145927,"title":"","content":"Speaking of Sonja Blue, that got me thinking; there are two subsets of Urban/Dark Fantasy, which seem to be gender-divided. Both feature heroes who are &quot;investigators of the supernatural&quot;, but when the hero is male, the focus is on him as a &quot;detective&quot; type, while the females are usually straight up killers of the supernatural...<br /> <br /> The obvious reason for this is that everyone is ripping off Buffy, who is pretty much the prototype for this type of character. But it is interesting that traditional gender roles are reversed here, in that the male heroes are NOT the ones to go for the violent approach, usually outwitting the monsters they come up against...<br /> <br /> Probably the most popular and successful male hero of this sort is Harry Dresden, but John Constantine is definitely his direct ancestor. Is there anyone that predates him? The only one I can think of might be Clive Barker's Harry D'amour, but even if he was published first, I'm not sure if Alan Moore would have read those short stories...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T13:00:48-07:00","id":145941,"title":"","content":"Who or what is Sonja Blue?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T15:01:56-07:00","id":146064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/132837-so-constantine-has-a-new-series-premiering-on-nbc-this-fall?p=145941#post145941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who or what is Sonja Blue?</div> </div> </div> </div>The poor man's Anita Blake.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Kidding! She's a vampire/vampire hunter, main character of a series of novels by Nancy Collins, one of which is a crossover with the Classic World of Darkness. Not sure how that works...did they say she was a Kindred, or just &quot;something else vampiric&quot;? <br /> <br /> Collins has had a long relationship with WW, and evidence suggests that she was at the root of WWs attempt to sue the makers of Underworld for plaigerism (the story WW claimed Underworld ripped off was one she had written for a WoD anthology). It might be telling that the same filmmakers made subsequent movies that arguably rip off both Mage and Promethean without a peep from WW...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T04:04:33-07:00","id":146568,"title":"","content":"Seems more Dresden Files then Constantine... But that could work well. Too bad the guy writing and producing it is an asshole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/363-muscadomestica","name":"MuscaDomestica","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T06:14:47-07:00","id":147791,"title":"","content":"As much as I did (and still do) like Hellblazer, I'm not entirely sure I'll like this. I'm just not getting the vibe of &quot;moral ambiguity&quot; from the trailer, and I'm not sure how they'll handle his habit of getting people around him killed, often doing it himself, albeit usually for a good reason (like to contain a powerful demon, or something). I'm not saying definitively it'll suck, but John Constantine is a difficult and complex character, and adaptations do not have a good track record in the past.<br /> <br /> That said, if they do nail it, <b>awesome sauce</b>! But I'm doubtful they will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T15:18:52-07:00","id":156935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Allan53</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/132837-so-constantine-has-a-new-series-premiering-on-nbc-this-fall?p=147791#post147791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As much as I did (and still do) like Hellblazer, I'm not entirely sure I'll like this. I'm just not getting the vibe of &quot;moral ambiguity&quot; from the trailer, and I'm not sure how they'll handle his habit of getting people around him killed, often doing it himself, albeit usually for a good reason (like to contain a powerful demon, or something). I'm not saying definitively it'll suck, but John Constantine is a difficult and complex character, and adaptations do not have a good track record in the past.<br /> <br /> That said, if they do nail it, <b>awesome sauce</b>! But I'm doubtful they will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Um...the trailer establishes that he *condemned a young girls' soul to hell*! What more &quot;ambiguity&quot; do you want?!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T02:07:36-07:00","id":157665,"title":"","content":"That seems a reference to the Newcastle incident, so there's hope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}